d incidents that occurred in the last week. Apparently warriors coming from the west are involved, and the defeated all bore the markings of a sword brim on their bodies. Kan'u Unchou, a special A-rank, set out to investigate the enemies, but supposedly loses to them. Ekitoku suspects Kansai has people that are S-ranks, since this is the only way such a defeat could be explained. They then all plan to meet up with Chouun Shiryuu and Kan at a nearby temple...","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2014-12-21","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":26,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/qn4EZXtsvz6YpFPukFlHyv9A6bs.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qn4EZXtsvz6YpFPukFlHyv9A6bs.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/37584/season/0/episode/19"},{"id":"3041095","seasonNumber":0,"episodeNumber":20,"title":{"value":"Episodio 20","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Sonsaku Hakufu along with Shokatsuryou Koumei, Chouhi Ekitoku, and Ryuubi Gentoku are investigating Magatama-related incidents that occurred in the last week. Apparently warriors coming from the west are involved, and the defeated all bore the markings of a sword brim on their bodies. Kan'u Unchou, a special A-rank, set out to investigate the enemies, but supposedly loses to them. Ekitoku suspects Kansai has people that are S-ranks, since this is the only way such a defeat could be explained. They then all plan to meet up with Chouun Shiryuu and Kan at a nearby temple...","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2014-12-28","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":26,"stills":[],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/37584/season/0/episode/20"},{"id":"3041097","seasonNumber":0,"episodeNumber":21,"title":{"value":"Episodio 21","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Cao Cao and Sun Ce, two of the three heads, are robbed of the magatama by the \"magatama hunting\" directly by the head of Yamato Gakuin, Himiko. In order to protect the injured companions and to recapture the stolen magatama, the fighters of Xuchang, Nanyang and Chengdu head to the enemy land, Yamato Gakuin. Everyone was soaked in the mood of a school trip for a short time like a high school student, but at the inn where they stayed, they were attacked by an enemy thug, Kansai warrior Ashiya Doman.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2019-01-03","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":28,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/vZRKQlsNtEqcy4mtIC3y1jwaGDU.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vZRKQlsNtEqcy4mtIC3y1jwaGDU.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/37584/season/0/episode/21"},{"id":"3041098","seasonNumber":0,"episodeNumber":22,"title":{"value":"Episodio 22","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Liu Bei and his friends have been scattered by the assault of Doman Aya. Meanwhile, in Takebayashi, Guan Yu confronted Musashi, the best swordsman in Japan. Guan Yu's consciousness gradually awakens in front of Musashi's overwhelming strength, which can be glimpsed from the unique atmosphere! On the other hand, Zhang Fei, who saw his lack of power, begins his training to awaken to become an S-rank warrior under the purple ghost.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2019-02-03","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":28,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/iCsMROTNCuXzrZmUqPkxutGJ7Vw.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/iCsMROTNCuXzrZmUqPkxutGJ7Vw.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/37584/season/0/episode/22"},{"id":"3041099","seasonNumber":0,"episodeNumber":23,"title":{"value":"Episodio 23","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Finally, the Kanto fighters who gathered at the target Yamato Gakuin. Kansai fighters who wore strange ki by the curse of Himiko were waiting there. Zhang Fei, who was in the middle of his training, also saw the crisis of Liu Bei and decided to head to Yamato Gakuin. However, due to Zhang Fei's good fight, the Kanto fighters collapse one after another in front of Himiko, who draws out the power of the magatama. Guan Yu and Liu Bei are cornered. At that time, Zhang Fei's magatama shines. Zhang Fei, Awakening-- !!","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2019-03-03","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":27,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/usHQclIOvjbBUNaBQ06jmyTOk3Q.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/usHQclIOvjbBUNaBQ06jmyTOk3Q.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/37584/season/0/episode/23"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/37584/season/0"},"fields":{},"episodes":{"19":{"checkedAt":1793427310100,"status":"ok"}}}
